  <reason>Subject and account: The subject of this report is Zeeshan Rehman, holder of account PK**HABB****7187, opened on 23 August 2024. The customer's declared occupation is medical sales officer (salaried), with a declared income of PKR 220,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the period 3 March 2026 to 26 March 2026, the account recorded 17 credits totalling PKR 21,387,000 as well as 5 debits totalling PKR 17,933,000. The credits included 16 cash deposits totalling PKR 21,167,000, made over the counter at 3 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch). The activity was detected on 26 March 2026, when Tazama typology STR-PK-01 scored 320 against an alert threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: 10 of 16 cash deposits (62%) were between PKR 1,600,000 and PKR 1,999,999, totalling PKR 17,774,000, just below the cash transaction reporting threshold of PKR 2,000,000. The cash was deposited across 3 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch) rather than at a single branch. Credits in the activity window were 97.2 times the declared monthly income, against a declared income of PKR 220,000 per month. A note by Branch Operations (15 March 2026): "Customer asked why deposits of PKR 2 million or more need extra paperwork and declined to explain the source of the cash." Taken together, these indicators are consistent with suspected structuring; the reporting entity has not established the underlying offence.

Flow of funds: Of the outgoing funds, PKR 17,933,000 was sent to Crescent Imports (PK**CRES****1592, Synthetic Bank A) in 5 transactions. Funds did not remain in the account: debits equal to 84% of credits, with a median of 2.7 hours between the latest credit and each debit.

Other considerations: Screening of the subject returned no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse-media screening on 29 March 2026.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Action taken: a note by L2 analyst (29 March 2026): "Account placed under enhanced monitoring pending the reporting decision. No contact made with the customer about this review."</reason>
